%% title: Deploy, step 1 of 3: the deploy job hands a release to the service
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant CI as deploy job
    participant R as Rust binary
    participant O as ghcr
    participant S as estate-kit service
    CI->>R: validate offline
    R-->>CI: no diagnostics
    CI->>O: promote digests, publish the Intent Fragment
    CI->>S: deploy (GitHub OIDC token)
    S-->>CI: rollout id, event stream opens
